   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "This is Kukhnya, a Russian comedy set in the kitchen of Claude Monet, a smart French restaurant in Moscow. Chef Barinov rules it with a loud voice, and young Max is the newest cook. In this episode a huge banquet lands on the pastry section, and the chef's small daughter ends up spending the whole day in the kitchen. First, Louis, the French pastry chef, goes to the chef for help. You'll hear it in Russian first, and you don't need to catch every word.",
