   "t": " for this.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "louis",
   "t": "Но он ничего не умеет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'But he does not know how to do anything.' Complaining about the new guy, Louis uses ",
